    number: "−99.9%",
    numberLabel: "worst fall of a 3x US stock fund, 1927 to 2026, simulated",
    href: "/strategies/market-timing/",
  },
  {
    title: "Bitcoin",
    verdict: "No",
    sentence:
      "The only holding tested that made the portfolio's worst fall deeper at every weight. At most 2% as a bet, and zero is fine.",
    number: await figureValue("bitcoin-drawdown-deepened"),
    numberLabel: "a portfolio's worst fall before and after a 10% bitcoin holding, 2015 to 2026",
    href: "/strategies/gold-and-bitcoin/",
  },
  {
    title: "Crash-insurance funds",
    verdict: "No",
    sentence:
      "The best-known one lost about 7% a year since 2017 and lost money in 2022, the bear market it was bought for.",
    number: "−13%",
    numberLabel: "TAIL in calendar 2022, while US stocks fell about a quarter",
    href: "/strategies/crash-protection/",
  },
  {
    title: "Buffer funds",
    verdict: "No",
    sentence:
      "A cap on your gains in exchange for a cushion on your losses. Priced on a century of twelve-month windows, the package costs you.",
    number: "−2.4% to −4.1% a year",
    numberLabel: "what the cap-and-cushion package was worth on 1,183 twelve-month windows since 1926",
    href: "/strategies/crash-protection/",
  },
  {
    title: "Long US government bonds as insurance",
    verdict: "No",
    sentence:
      "Two hundredths of a percent a month more than cash in the worst stock months, bought with a huge fall of their own.",
