    numberLabel: "worst fall of long US government bonds against cash, 1926 to 2025",
    href: "/strategies/crash-protection/",
  },
  {
    title: "Commodities",
    verdict: "No",
    sentence:
      "Inflation protection, and no help in a crash: a recession that sinks stocks sinks demand for oil and copper too.",
    number: "36%",
    numberLabel: "of the worst stock months since 1926 in which commodities rose",
    href: "/strategies/gold-and-bitcoin/",
  },
  {
    title: "Corporate and high-yield bonds",
    verdict: "No",
    sentence:
      "They track US government bonds closely and add a slice of stock risk. A little extra return inside a bond holding, never protection.",
